                        "entry_id": "8c2b18aa-4733-3501-a8ba-43eda068bb73",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of grape grown in Hungary, commonly used in tokays."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "35f21ba4-c62f-41c9-8078-a388c6a8f79d",
                                "sense_id": "7a4ea390-4e5b-3c3d-9493-d9f059c89bd5",
                                "text": "[…] the furmint (muscatel) of Somlo, full of fire and of the noble aroma drawn from the volcanic earth in which the grapes are grown, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "118aa34e-1fc3-4461-8879-efc9cca3ef22",
                                "sense_id": "7a4ea390-4e5b-3c3d-9493-d9f059c89bd5",
                                "text": "[…] from the wine regions of the Tokaj mountains (where the \"froment\" grape, the ancestor of the furmint, was introduced by Walloon settlers) […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36fda0d6-7d69-43d7-85d7-c67476d04009",
                                "sense_id": "7a4ea390-4e5b-3c3d-9493-d9f059c89bd5",
                                "text": "Varietals commonly affected by botrytis include chenin blanc, furmint, muscadelle, muscat, riesling, sauvignon blanc, and semillon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e24bd0f5-293b-438c-a5fd-19d3548e1676",
                                "sense_id": "7a4ea390-4e5b-3c3d-9493-d9f059c89bd5",
                                "text": "It was made from the furmint grape, which is better known in Hungary’s lusciously sweet tokays, but this was delicate, floral and just right with a tart chicken curry dish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d18923d1-d9df-4b6c-9092-6e24dcae31b3",
                                "sense_id": "7a4ea390-4e5b-3c3d-9493-d9f059c89bd5",
                                "text": "I’m not sure if it qualifies as a trend just yet, but you may have noticed more of the central and eastern European grape variety furmint cropping up in your wine shop in the past couple of years."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
